  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Verified workflow & dependencies",
      "items": [
        "Ingest \u2192 query / investigate \u2192 review; ask and analyze-timeline add optional AI. CLI dispatch: cli.py, v1_cli.py, v2_cli.py.",
        "EVTX uses python-evtx + defusedxml in-process. Other parsers run in a child process (requirements.txt; ingest/evtx.py; artifacts/worker.py)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Sensitive evidence crossings",
      "items": [
        "Input files \u2192 parsers; worker \u2192 temporary SQLite \u2192 primary DB. Hash/size checks precede publication; partial ingestion is reported (ingest/evtx.py; artifacts/ingest.py).",
        "Selected fields and question \u2192 loopback HTTP POST /v1/chat/completions; model JSON returns for validation. No DNS, proxies or redirects (llm/client.py). stdout can include raw evidence."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Facts, assumptions & artifacts",
      "items": [
        "Database, temporary stages and migration .sqlite backups are generated files; review output goes to stdout (database/migrations.py; cli.py). Model analysis is not evidence (llm/ask.py).",
        "Grouping is conceptual: file stores are resources, not services. Local server is the client contract; model identity, deployment, disk protection and downstream stdout custody are unverified. SRC links pin verified code."
      ]
    }
  ]
